<title>AUSTRALIA: Golden West boosts year operating profit.</title>
<headline>Golden West boosts year operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to March 31</p>
<p>		   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    3.13  vs   0.64</p>
<p>    Net				     1.18  vs   1.03</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    nil   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Sales				 606.87  vs  77.16</p>
<p>    Other income			  0.56  vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   2.4   vs   3.7</p>
<p>    Abnormal expense		    1.17  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Tax				     1.14  vs   0.15 gain</p>
<p>    Interest expense		    3.47  vs   0.30</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  1.72  vs   0.58</p>
<p>    Minorities			    0.35  vs   0.24</p>
<p>NOTE: Golden West Refining Corp Ltd is a Western Australia-based international precious metals refining group. The 1996/97 result includes 7-1/2 months trading from U.S.-based Handy and Harman Refinery Group, acquired in August 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
